abstract: >-
  PulseShift is an organizer-first decision-support tool for planning
  outdoor activities under climate stress. It combines NOAA weather
  forecasts and EPA AirNow air-quality (AQI) data to rank safer
  scheduling and adaptation options, with an evaluation covering
  decision-curve analysis, exposure-response modeling, and equity
  across day types and seasons.
